      "message": "this is not this patch\u0027s fault, but it was the last one to touch this definition. \n\nWhat is CONFIG_RW_MEM_OFF ? \n\nThis file\u0027s definition implies that it is the offset into the flash device where the rw section starts. But in macros in core/cortex-m/ec.lds.S it is considered the offset into the RW portion of the flash, from which the rw image is actually based.",
